  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Early text states a restriction on primeval sea and primeval essence, and a threat to essence over time after the victim is inflicted. That is enough to leave the Flower Wine Monk unable to fight as a normal Gu Master while elders close in.",
        "chapters": [
          15
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The fourth generation clan leader uses it as a hidden finishing move after pretending to beg for mercy. The Flower Wine Monk kills him anyway and then fights the elders while under the Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          15
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-against-the-flower-wine-monk",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan, still working from the wall scene, treats Moonshadow Gu as what dragged the Flower Wine Monk toward death after that battle.",
        "chapters": [
          16
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-against-the-flower-wine-monk",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
