    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Clan recipe material for Illusory Moon Gu says that once refined, Illusory Moon Gu can serve as the basis for rank four Moonshadow Gu, and that Moonshadow Gu can be implanted into a Gu Master’s aperture to suppress use of primeval essence. Fang Yuan then states concrete rates: it suppresses 30% of the primeval essence in a rank four aperture, 15% in a rank five aperture, and 60% in a rank three aperture. For a C grade talent with only about 40% to 50% essence, that leaves no usable essence and no battle strength. He also judges that if the Gu entered his own aperture, the Spring Autumn Cicada’s aura would refine it at once and make it his.",
        "chapters": [
          156
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "suppression-detail-and-fusion-line",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_c_grade",
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan then revises his early death reading: Moonshadow Gu only suppresses primeval essence and cripples the Gu Master; it was not the cause of the Flower Wine Monk’s severe injuries or death.",
        "chapters": [
          156
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "suppression-detail-and-fusion-line",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Infection by Moonshadow Gu restricts primeval essence and is not fatal enough on its own. Because the Monk still needed to refine the Heavenly Essence Treasure Lotus without drawing attention, he stopped open slaughter and worked from the dark instead.",
        "chapters": [
          163
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "suppression-detail-and-fusion-line",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_heavenly_essence_treasure_lotus"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Moonshadow Gu also could not cause the blood-covered wounds Fang Yuan remembers from the Photo-audio Gu image.",
        "chapters": [
          183
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "suppression-detail-and-fusion-line",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_photo_audio_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
